## got this error while running PCA, so rectifying it##
Error: Sample(s) present with no genotype data.  Use --mind to filter them out.

plink --bfile dataset \
      --allow-extra-chr \
      --mind 0.9 \
      --make-bed \
      --out dataset_pruned_clean

Why 0.9?
--mind 0.9 → removes samples with >90% missing data
This specifically targets samples with almost no data

